            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Even More Gestures 0.2.20

- Reduced background wakeups by polling Accessibility only while setup is pending and updating the pause countdown only while a timed pause is active.
- Pausing gestures now stops trackpad input until gestures resume.
- Checks for refreshed defaults now run daily rather than waking hourly.
]]></description>
